<title>FRANCE: Schneider 1996 net rises 61.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Schneider 1996 net rises 61.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable			   1,320  vs	     817</p>
<p>    Net dividend (francs)		     five  vs	   four</p>
<p>    Operating				    3,999  vs	   3,676</p>
<p>    Net income before goodwill writedown 1,950  vs	   1,423</p>
<p>    Exceptional charges			  465  vs	     502</p>
<p>    Net interest expenses			735  vs	   1,083</p>
<p>    Goodwill amortisation			630  vs	     606</p>
<p>    Sales					 61,637  vs   59,421</p>
<p>    Net debt				     5,525  vs    7,802</p>
<p>    Operating cash flow			4,153  vs    3,815</p>
<p>NOTE -- Schneider said in a statement it would pay the dividend on July 2, 1997, only in cash.</p>
</text>
